{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f20288eb4992b01ff5be1df8b2015073b417ba78af09721d2dbf49cd2eab399a", "ja": "不安なままで", "zh": "在不安之中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4d0dc59795d0b9b84d4c455ec6970a4241af28db618a82e1033198f338fa20ae", "ja": "ツアーの宣伝も兼ねてバラエティ番組に出演\nしたアイドル達。収録中に宣言したツアーの\n抱負で、大きなことを言い過ぎたかもと不安\nになる紬に、不安があるからこそ成長できる\nと語る朋花。", "zh": "为了宣传巡演而参加了综艺节目的偶像们。\n紬在录制时宣言了巡演的目标，担心自己\n是不是说得太过头了。朋花对她说，正因为\n感到不安，才有成长的可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e24976c0188badbbf80e51f3512f20ab2ee17fb71297d2a9be84076734ba688d", "ja": "（今日はバラエティ番組に出演中。ツアーの宣伝も\nさせてもらえるそうだ……頼んだぞ、みんな！）", "zh": "（今天正在参加综艺节目的录制。听说还能顺便宣传一下巡演……拜托你们了，大家！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1001_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "7091dc4ab858b4e0c70dab0df933a0789b703c7147d94f7080e56d8e0922ccd3", "ja": "……っと、そう言えば。\n765プロのみなさんは、今ツアー中なんでしたよね？", "zh": "……啊，话说回来。\n765事务所的各位，现在正在巡演中对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "b3d741dcb3a6d52adc8ea1f3ff228b1e9020aa1e963eea4f2b5c6443c7e682ca", "ja": "はい。ツアーの第3弾になる\n『EmotionLight』公演に向けて、準備中です。", "zh": "是的。我们正在为巡演第3弹的《EmotionLight》公演做准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "17e560957a1a4bfa6af8a1f667705dbefc94667688b33976507264a9a1c7f106", "ja": "朝公演、昼公演ときて、私たちは夕方がテーマです。", "zh": "早场、午场之后，我们的主题是傍晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f86b6ff1c489317ea9d1d2b56b720c9fb71dddc8054f74fe73f0ec0894485a86", "ja": "みなさんにとって、憩いの時間となれるよう、\n日々頑張っております。どうぞ、ご期待ください。", "zh": "希望能成为让各位放松身心的时光，\n我们每天都在为此努力。还请大家拭目以待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1005_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "cb07639d3611111396bbf88e571fe8247e28949dfcf3b6866cecaa9ff567b759", "ja": "なるほど……しっとりした\n雰囲気のパフォーマンスが多くなりそうですね。", "zh": "原来如此……看来会有更多氛围沉静的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "1bd6a7e39a19bc80679551a20e5bdd4084b47722c8c4049ddd5a07efc4bd708b", "ja": "そんな感じかな！　でもそればっかりじゃなくて、\nアタシ達らしさも忘れないでいきたいよねっ！", "zh": "差不多就是这种感觉吧！不过也不能只有那样，\n还是要别忘了展现出属于我们的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "07ca4384d8e57081ce20798e1bf42b97161c9b877b7dfe92d100dd4618f29816", "ja": "夕暮れ空みたいに、たくさんの色が混じり合う……\nそんな公演になったらな～って思うんです。", "zh": "就像向晚的天空那样，汇聚着形形色色的色彩……\n我想呈现出这样一场公演呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "78d560eed308521bf7ca82201e62d09dc9dc70748e556e4e17ae58644c80d790", "ja": "もちろん、バラバラという意味ではありません～。\n一丸となって、公演を成功させてみせますよ～。", "zh": "当然不是说要各自为战～。\n我们会团结一心，努力让公演取得成功～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1009_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "ad0d1d2d03a27e8d6ecc68af1f79080d3de7e1871aaa376293af60aae15a6b93", "ja": "それは楽しみですね！　765プロのみなさん、\nありがとうございました。頑張ってください！", "zh": "真令人期待呢！765事务所的各位，谢谢大家。请加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cded9e5bb89981c91f6644e1c616cfb2b4a06fc6ad35fea350649630ad597bd9", "ja": "ありがとうございました。", "zh": "非常谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "aee8734c023b89b0f584d98906a1d47aa9f5d4d84ce4b8c3c47cb5044c6e7325", "ja": "ありがとうございましたっ！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "3258a85a48445d38e6c18ed147bf163fc140199790c7d093e2dffd6b498ddbc0", "ja": "ありがとうございました～。", "zh": "非常感谢大家～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2f667274d56ffe4bacdf8aaa18c088397895d5118d59812925b5a0d94ed412dc", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nバッチリ、いい宣伝になったと思うよ。ありがとう！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n我觉得这次宣传效果非常好。谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4a4e21aba6223b0e9a4eac7d8f9424bd1ba7415c24274044a77f6f7bc0bfe858", "ja": "本当ですか？　私は大きな口を利いてしまったかもと、\nいささか心配なのですが……。", "zh": "真的吗？我有点担心自己是不是说了些大话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "07bd9cebd3f9fd456385586418d7ef07ef775c8907bdb9d367c47387df486b4d", "ja": "そうですか？\nあれくらいは言っていいと思いますけど。", "zh": "是吗？\n不过我觉得，那种程度的话还是可以说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "97d18b8c7272e628d09bf18c3b3612450556f16389f6edbf7a75b017405f54a9", "ja": "具体的には、まだ決まってないことも多いから、\n不安になるのかもね。アタシも、少しだけわかるよ。", "zh": "具体来说，还有很多事情没定下来，所以你可能会感到不安吧。我也稍微能理解一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "5d936cf4876fa587c2e513b8dfac68881c914a76ed4be519b9c5bc5656ffec89", "ja": "みんなも不安なんだね。\nうーん……どうしたらいいのかな、ええと。", "zh": "大家也都感到不安呢。\n嗯……该怎么办才好呢，那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "052b244c867c964d8534026728bc8250a74bcd281a0cb09f8db02808ac3c38bc", "ja": "不安なのは、悪いことではないと思いますよ～？\n成長するためにどうすればいいか、探せますから～。", "zh": "感到不安并不是坏事哦～？\n因为这样才能寻找该如何成长～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "46f2afea23f0768f9679e4ae412d4513425cc7f05902d61bf7d80b086ce7960c", "ja": "なるほどね。成長するための不安、か。\n朋花、良いこと言うじゃん♪", "zh": "原来如此。为了成长而产生的不安吗？朋花，你说得真好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "7ef49f168c40c894ef3c8fe52ba436354c113876924b1c215a1d2d11eb997c65", "ja": "できることは、まあ……たくさんありますけど。\n今は……無理をしないことだと思います。", "zh": "能做到的事情嘛……还是有很多的。\n不过现在……我觉得还是不要勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "5401160a3cde596ac8b015036978183183e606232f9ade831b40f9c824792469", "ja": "わっ、志保ちゃん、大人だ……！\nそうだね、アイドルは健康第一、体が資本だもんね。", "zh": "哇，志保好成熟哦……！\n说得对，偶像最注重的就是健康，身体才是本钱嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "ebfe677ac5e8fe22b411b5c4540ba5b5097c21646393a3b7ba5a4bc98303a0f4", "ja": "それじゃ、今日のところはゆっくり休もっか。\n明日また、一緒に頑張ろうね！", "zh": "那么，今天就先好好休息吧。\n明天再一起加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0267_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0267_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "190cddee706955ba812ff47ec355532c4713d15c045fdf2b1aa9491ceef95958", "ja": "（みんな、しっかり不安と向き合うことができている\nようだ……本当に頼もしい限りだな）", "zh": "（大家似乎都能认真面对自己的不安了……真是让人放心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
